### 🏁 FINAL WORDS

Building and maintaining a custom ROM is a labor of love, endless hours of compiling, and occasionally fighting with SELinux denials at 3 AM. Alch3myOS is built by Android enthusiasts, for Android enthusiasts, with the singular goal of pushing Android hardware to its absolute limit.

Whether you are a maintainer submitting your first device tree, a tester hunting down bugs, or just someone looking for a cleaner, faster Android experience—welcome to the project. 

Grab your platform tools, unlock that bootloader, and happy flashing! 🚀

